{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲國家阿爾巴尼亞首都地拉那（Tirana）的學生示威周四（15日）連續第3天演變成警民衝突，示威者抗議學費上漲及政府貪腐，要求總理拉馬（Edi Rama）下台。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:19:38.119838+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:26:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T03:17:35.122576+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:38.598191+00:00","content_hash":"31450c75672654d542da56da7187532ff9b881a56fed2c23e8d18830664ea0ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}